  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>310</x>
      <y>510</y>
      <w>430</w>
      <h>200</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Note..
/*
*The main performance bottleneck comes from using a list 
*inside AddressBook, which forces operations like 
*removeContact(name) or any name lookup to scan the entire list, 
*making them O(n) and increasingly slow as the address book 
*grows. The simplest and most effective fix is to replace the
* internal list with a HashMap&lt;String, Contact&gt;, which reduces 
*add, remove, and lookup operations to O(1) on average, 
*eliminating the bottleneck and greatly improving overall
*performance.
*/
</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
